		{
			description: [
				"Added 13 new unlimited greenhouse components"
				"4 infinite components of simple matter"
				"Only 64 ingredients are needed to create the Polymer Catalytic Recipe."
				"To prevent contamination of formulas, recipes related to rebuilding materials have been temporarily removed."
				"Except for the module recipes, most of the recipes that needed to be researched before are no longer needed."
				"Modifying Merge Batch Processing Logic"
				"(Recipe will not be hidden if set)"
				"Slightly Modified Petri Dish Extraction Recipe"
				"2.2beta1 update log"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Fixed an issue where the fusion module mission could not be recognized"
				"The Petri dish extraction recipe has been slightly modified."
				"Added reverse circulation of expanded space fluid"
				"2.2beta2 update log"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Added 2.0x time-consuming multiplier (automatic) maintenance compartment and multiple compression parallel control compartments"
				"2.2beta3 update log"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"New beautiful useless objects (Fragile Mortar and Fragile Knife)"
				"Fragile tools can be eaten"
				"Added a new Dahua anti-bone block to the essence block formula"
				"Repaired and Improved Energy Burst Ender Pearl Recipe"
				"Remove No. 23 uranium treatment formula containing impurities from production line detonation"
				"Add rare earth extraction formula"
				"Add 4 infinite components MAX"
				"Fixed issue with not mining meteorites and not being able to collect large amounts of debris in the final ore collection"
				"Add a generic board component package"
				"Added unlimited parallel macro atoms"
				"Production line detonation updated to 0.7:"
				"Extracting ice fragments, lightning processing ice fragments, simplifying time fragments, simplifying miracles..."
				"2.2beta4 update log"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Fixed the issue that the fragile tools task component package was not updated synchronously"
				"Fixed the issue that the Essence Cube recipe without circuit did not work"
				"Removed indestructible grinding ball formula (fake indestructible is useless)"
				"fix1 record"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Convert the huge amount of catalysts that don't fit into some sample sets into the form of an item component"
				"Removed maximum strength field magic creation (added)"
				"Production Line Detonation updated to 0.7.5fix2:"
				"Synthesis recipe converted to p2p assembly ordered synthesis changed to stone cutting"
				"Boiling water, Taran combined plasma, fishing enhancement, some magnetic substance recipes"
			]
